[en.FOCUS_C18_TALK_TO_RAINSHINE]
Talk to Rain Shine

[en.FOCUS_C18_TALK_TO_RAINSHINE_desc]
The truth may often be right in front of you, but Autumn Blaze finds it hard to convince herself to accept it. More and more mysteries are intertwined, and the intersection seems to be on the former leader - Rain Shine. As the former leader, Rain Shine obviously knows many secrets that Autumn Blaze does not know, and these secrets may be the key to solving all the mysteries.

[en.FOCUS_C18_TALK_TO_RAINSHINE_TOOLTIP]
We have obtained §YRain Shine’s magic password§!

[zh.FOCUS_C18_TALK_TO_RAINSHINE]
与雨晴的谈话

[zh.FOCUS_C18_TALK_TO_RAINSHINE_desc]
也许真相往往就在眼前，只是秋烨难以说服自己接受。越来越多的谜团交织在一起，而交点似乎就在前任领袖 —— 雨晴的身上。雨晴作为前任领袖，显然掌握着许多秋烨不知道的秘密，而这些秘密，也许就是解开所有谜团的关键。

[zh.FOCUS_C18_TALK_TO_RAINSHINE_TOOLTIP]
我们获得了 §Y雨晴的魔法密码§!

